stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Requested row slice complete
  s1: Rows scanned 0, rows emitted 0
  s2: Rows scanned 1, rows emitted 1
  s3: Rows scanned 1, rows emitted 0
  s4: Rows scanned 2, rows emitted 2
  s5: Rows scanned 2, rows emitted 1
  s6: Rows scanned 2, rows emitted 0
  [*] --> s0
  [*] --> s1
  s1 --> s0: Emit next requested row
  s1 --> s2: Emit next requested row
  s1 --> s3: Skip offset row
  s2 --> s0: Emit next requested row
  s2 --> s4: Emit next requested row
  s3 --> s0: Emit next requested row
  s3 --> s5: Emit next requested row
  s3 --> s6: Skip offset row
  s4 --> s0: Emit next requested row
  s5 --> s0: Emit next requested row
  s6 --> s0: Emit next requested row or Skip offset row
